<title>USA: Admin., Republicans near budget pact--White House.</title>
<headline>Admin., Republicans near budget pact--White House.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>A White House official said on Friday that the Clinton administration and congressional Republicans were nearing a balanced budget agreement.</p>
